sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Left side
    participant R as Right side
    L/|-R: solid top reverse
    L\|-R: solid bottom reverse
    L//-R: stick top reverse
    L\\-R: stick bottom reverse
    L/|--R: dotted solid top reverse
    L\|--R: dotted solid bottom reverse
    L//--R: dotted stick top reverse
    L\\--R: dotted stick bottom reverse
    R/|-L: solid top reverse back
    R\\--L: dotted stick bottom reverse back
